  "proof_supplied": [
    "Absolutecontinuity localizes finiteenergy to the actually proved smallenergy puncturedL4 gauge theorem.",
    "Genuinely smooth cutoffs retain F_chiB=chiF_B+dchi wedgeB+(chi\u00b2-chi)B wedgeB. HolderandL4 absolutecontinuity prove strongL2 curvature approximation and vanishing ASDerror. No distributional extension of B curvature is assumed.",
    "Actual smooth-ball Coulomb gauge existence and full Sobolev extraction construct a W1,2 Coulomb ASD limit across thepoint; actual weakASD regularity makes it smooth.",
    "A second actual Rellich/diagonal extraction constructs the limiting SU2 gauge on thepuncture from du_j=u_ja_j-Bu_j. The limit equation gives smooth gauge equivalence.",
    "Rescaling and an explicit radial flattening of the local gauge domain produce one smooth gauge on the entire original punctured ball, with transformedconnection smoothASD everywhere."
  ],
  "precise_scope": "SmoothunperturbedEuclideanASD su2 connection FORM on puncturedB1 with arbitraryfiniteL2 curvatureenergy, in a given trivialization. Gauge smooth on entire puncturedball and transformedconnection smooth on allB1. Gauge itself neednotextend atpoint or satisfyboundarycondition.",
